A||N||14||chester||Spanked my first 5.0!  Gotta love it!||||6||
Z||000000||chester||06-30-2001||09:39 AM||||Since my new engine build I have been reluctant to do anything until she got broke in.  Of course that's when all boys and their toys pull up to ya pipeing and so on. Z-28's, Mudstain 5.0's, T/A's and the like. Up untill last night I would gracefully bow down not wanting to risk damage.  Well, since I rolled over 2500 miles last night I decided that ENOUGH IS ENOUGH.  I was out for a ride with Elvira (my wife). We were cruising to find some blasting bead (just got me a compressor and sand blaster  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.) We were comming up on the I95 interchange off of Rt33 in Portsmouth when I noticed a white Mudstain GT weaving in and out of traffic behind me. Hmmmm, a contender!  Of course the light turned red and he made it a point to pull up beside me. He gave me the usual "I'm driving a 5.0 and you ain't got **** " look.  That's ok, I think to myself, we'll have us some fun!  We both start watching the light.  1, 2, 3, Green!  Off we go.  I think he was a little surprised that with all his might and effort he coulden't get away.  Here we are side by side his lane to end.  Ok, I say to myself, be a courtious driver.  Since it is a 45 and we are at 100+ I back off and let him over.  We come up on the I95 interchange - SWEET, he's hitting the interstate!  Elvira, HOLD ON! We hit the onramp at about 60 and steadly accelerate.  I can see him getting ready to loose it in the turn so he backs off. Ha, my chance to catch up! We come out of the on ramp and nail it.  2nd, 6000 rpm, shift to third.  I couldn't belive I was gaining on him with athority!  By the time we got on the interstate I was 2 carlenghts in front of him.  I pull into the left lane and nailed it! Bye bye Mudstain.  It was cool!  The best part was I was comming up on the car in front of me FAST.  What would it be but a 85 Fiero GT! He saw me comming up on him fast and yeilded to the right. I whipped by and he joined be for a short high speed bout. When I got to my exit I slowed down and looked over at the driver.  The big Thumbs up!  Made my day!  Anyway, that was my first 5.0 spanking! What a RUSH!.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
