Z||000005||chester||06-30-2001||04:43 PM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dave Gunsul:<BR><B>Congrats! What engine are you running?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Running a 1988 Formula drivetrain. 2.8/Getrag combo with the following mods;<P>Bored .030 over.<BR>Crane 2030 cam<BR>TRW forged pistons (9.5:1)<BR>Heads shaved .020 mild port/polish<BR>ARP Racing hardware throughout<BR>SS valves<BR>Crane springs/retainers/locks/pushrods<BR>Comp Cams 1:1.6 roller tip rockers.<BR>Cloyes true double roller timing chain.<BR>High volume oil pump<BR>Windage tray<BR>FULL BALANCE! I run polly motor mounts with NO vibration!<BR>Adjustable fuel pressure regulator with guage.<BR>Magnacore 10MM racing wires<BR>19# Accel injectors<BR>Bored throttle body and plenum<BR>Accel Super Coil<BR>Custom headers<BR>Power pully kit<BR>Hypertech Stage III chip.<BR>FieroShop Cold air induction with K&N cone filter.<BR>Centerforce dual friction clutch and Dunlop SP9000 245/40/17's on the rear to put it all to the ground.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Here's a pic;<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_pic.jpg">  <P>I also have an MSD 6AL, flowmaster, high volume fuel pump and 2 1/4 exhaust ready to go just haven't had the time to put it in.<P>Future expansions are T3 Garret turbo<BR>Haltec programmable ECM<BR>Small shot of NOS (Like the Venom 2000 series   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)<P><BR>[This message has been edited by chester (edited 06-30-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by chester (edited 06-30-2001).]||||reg||1
